# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Amazon Complete Ecosystem Rule-Set (Amazon.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Covers Amazon Retail, AWS (Cloud/S3/CloudFront), Amazon AI
#              (Bedrock/Q/Nova/Kiro), Prime Video, Twitch, Audible/Kindle,
#              Alexa/Ring, Subsidiaries (IMDb/Goodreads) & Official ASNs.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,Amazon.list,Amazon,extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Amazon Brand Exclusive TLDs (亚马逊品牌专属顶级域名后缀)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aws
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audible
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,imdb
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kindle
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,yamaxun
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,zappos

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Amazon AI, Bedrock, Amazon Q, Nova & Kiro IDE (大模型、AI 助手与开发工具)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN,nova.amazon.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,kiro.dev
DOMAIN,q.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,codewhisperer.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,bedrock.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,bedrock-runtime.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN,bedrock-runtime.us-west-2.amazonaws.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,partyrock.aws
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sagemaker.aws

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Amazon Retail, Shorteners & Global Regional Stores (全球电商主站与短链接)
# 注：排除 .cn (z.cn / amazon.cn) 避免影响国内直连解析，其余全球站点通过收敛规则覆盖
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.co.jp
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.co.uk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.ca
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.de
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.es
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.fr
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.in
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.it
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.nl
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.pl
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.se
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.sg
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.ae
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.sa
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.eg
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.com.au
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.com.be
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.com.br
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.com.mx
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.com.sg
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.com.tr
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazon.jobs
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aboutamazon.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amzn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amzn.to
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amzn.asia
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amzn.eu
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,a.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,associates-amazon.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazonbusiness.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazonpay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazonpayments.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazontours.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazonuniversity.jobs
# 收敛匹配全球所有国家/地区二级后缀 (如 amazon.co.*, amazon.com.*)
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,.amazon.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
