# 11. Process & Client User-Agent Rules (macOS / iOS 客户端与开发工具进程匹配)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
USER-AGENT,InstantVideo.US*
USER-AGENT,Prime%20Video*
USER-AGENT,AIVApp*
USER-AGENT,Amazon*
USER-AGENT,Kindle*
USER-AGENT,Audible*
USER-AGENT,Alexa*
USER-AGENT,Twitch*
PROCESS-NAME,Prime Video
PROCESS-NAME,Kindle
PROCESS-NAME,Amazon Music
PROCESS-NAME,Amazon Chime
PROCESS-NAME,Kiro

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 12. Amazon / AWS Official ASNs & Core Anycast Blocks (官方自治系统号与核心 IP 段)
# 注：AWS 承载了全球大量第三方服务 (如 Notion/Slack/海外游戏)，若不希望所有 AWS IP 均走此策略组，
#     可注释掉最底部的 IP-ASN,16509 和 IP-ASN,14618，仅凭上方域名规则精准分流。
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IP-CIDR,13.32.0.0/15,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,13.35.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,13.224.0.0/14,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,18.64.0.0/14,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,52.84.0.0/15,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,54.182.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,54.192.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,54.230.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,54.239.128.0/18,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,54.239.192.0/19,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,54.240.192.0/18,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,99.84.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,108.156.0.0/14,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,143.204.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,204.246.164.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,204.246.168.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,205.251.192.0/19,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,205.251.249.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,23.246.0.0/18,no-resolve
# Twitch Live Video Edge IP Blocks (AS46489)
IP-CIDR,45.113.128.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,52.223.192.0/18,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,99.181.64.0/18,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,192.16.64.0/21,no-resolve
